"lines": [
{
"text": "The Lord\u2019s word came to Abram in a vision:",
"start": 14.021,
"end": 17.401
},
{
"text": "\u201cDo not fear, Abram. I am your shield;",
"start": 20.281,
"end": 23.562
},
{
"text": "your reward will be very great.\u201d",
"start": 26.942,
"end": 29.102
},
{
"text": "Abram said, \u201cMaster, Lord,",
"start": 31.722,
"end": 33.582
},
{
"text": "what will you give me?",
"start": 34.242,
"end": 35.402
},
{
"text": "I depart without a child.",
"start": 38.603,
"end": 40.143
},
{
"text": "This Eliezer of Damascus,",
"start": 41.783,
"end": 43.763
},
{
"text": "son of Masek, my home-born woman servant,",
"start": 44.183,
"end": 47.383
},
{
"text": "is my heir.\u201d",
"start": 47.523,
"end": 48.463
},
{
"text": "Abram said, \u201cI am grieved:",
"start": 50.764,
"end": 52.184
},
{
"text": "you have given me no seed.",
"start": 53.944,
"end": 55.984
},
{
"text": "My home-born servant",
"start": 57.204,
"end": 59.404
},
{
"text": "will inherit from me.\u201d",
"start": 61.224,
"end": 62.564
},
{
"text": "At once the Lord\u2019s voice came:",
"start": 62.764,
"end": 68.525
},
{
"text": "\u201cHe will not be your heir.",
"start": 69.345,
"end": 71.305
},
{
"text": "One born from you",
"start": 74.125,
"end": 75.605
},
{
"text": "will be your heir.\u201d",
"start": 75.845,
"end": 77.645
},
{
"text": "He brought Abram outside:",
"start": 77.685,
"end": 80.726
},
{
"text": "\u201cLook up at heaven; count the stars,",
"start": 81.906,
"end": 84.226
},
{
"text": "if you can number them all.\u201d",
"start": 84.246,
"end": 87.306
},
{
"text": "Then he said, \u201cSo shall your children be.\u201d",
"start": 88.626,
"end": 93.446
},
{
"text": "Abram believed God,",
"start": 95.847,
"end": 97.287
},
{
"text": "and God counted it to him as righteousness.",
"start": 98.387,
"end": 101.707
},
{
"text": "He said, \u201cI am God, who brought you",
"start": 102.387,
"end": 104.767
},
{
"text": "from the land of the Chaldeans",
"start": 105.007,
"end": 107.107
},
{
"text": "to give you this land as your inheritance.\u201d",
"start": 107.687,
"end": 110.628
},
{
"text": "Abram said, \u201cMaster, Lord,",
"start": 115.128,
"end": 116.988
},
{
"text": "how can I know I will inherit it?\u201d",
"start": 117.788,
"end": 119.848
},
{
"text": "He said, \u201cBring me a heifer",
"start": 121.028,
"end": 122.828
},
{
"text": "in her third year,",
"start": 122.968,
"end": 123.869
},
{
"text": "a she-goat in her third year,",
"start": 123.929,
"end": 127.149
},
{
"text": "and a ram in his third year,",
"start": 127.829,
"end": 129.489
},
{
"text": "a dove and a pigeon.\u201d",
"start": 130.029,
"end": 131.749
},
{
"text": "Abram brought them, cut the animals in two,",
"start": 133.509,
"end": 135.829
},
{
"text": "and laid each half opposite its mate.",
"start": 136.129,
"end": 138.75
},
{
"text": "But he did not divide the birds.",
"start": 139.71,
"end": 142.51
},
{
"text": "Birds came down upon the bodies,",
"start": 142.71,
"end": 145.77
},
{
"text": "upon the divided pieces;",
"start": 145.87,
"end": 149.17
},
{
"text": "Abram sat down beside them.",
"start": 149.47,
"end": 152.891
},
{
"text": "At sunset a trance fell upon Abram;",
"start": 154.711,
"end": 157.851
},
{
"text": "a great and gloomy terror fell on him.",
"start": 158.851,
"end": 160.931
},
{
"text": "The Lord said to Abram,",
"start": 161.251,
"end": 162.851
},
{
"text": "\u201cKnow for certain:",
"start": 164.271,
"end": 165.831
},
{
"text": "your seed will be strangers",
"start": 167.632,
"end": 169.572
},
{
"text": "in a land not their own.",
"start": 170.892,
"end": 172.412
},
{
"text": "They will be enslaved, afflicted and humbled",
"start": 174.032,
"end": 177.452
},
{
"text": "for four hundred years.\u201d",
"start": 178.272,
"end": 180.332
},
{
"text": "\u201cI will judge the nation they serve.",
"start": 180.572,
"end": 183.493
},
{
"text": "Afterward they will come forth here",
"start": 184.153,
"end": 187.133
},
{
"text": "with great possessions.\u201d",
"start": 187.213,
"end": 188.873
},
{
"text": "\u201cYou will go to your fathers in peace,",
"start": 191.053,
"end": 193.773
},
{
"text": "nourished in a good old age.\u201d",
"start": 193.873,
"end": 195.493
},
{
"text": "\u201cIn the fourth generation they will return here,",
"start": 197.254,
"end": 201.894
},
{
"text": "for the Amorites\u2019 sins are not yet complete.\u201d",
"start": 204.094,
"end": 207.534
},
{
"text": "As the sun went down, a flame appeared:",
"start": 213.135,
"end": 216.075
},
{
"text": "a smoking furnace and fiery lamps",
"start": 216.095,
"end": 219.355
},
{
"text": "passed between the divided pieces.",
"start": 219.995,
"end": 223.075
},
{
"text": "That day the Lord made a covenant with Abram:",
"start": 223.275,
"end": 227.136
},
{
"text": "\u201cTo your descendants I give this land,",
"start": 229.156,
"end": 233.916
},
{
"text": "from Egypt\u2019s river to the great Euphrates.\u201d",
"start": 236.076,
"end": 240.817
},
{
"text": "\u201cThe Kenites, the Kenezites,",
"start": 240.977,
"end": 243.917
},
{
"text": "and the Kedmoneans,\u201d",
"start": 244.097,
"end": 245.777
},
{
"text": "the Chettites, the Pherezites,",
"start": 247.497,
"end": 250.377
},
{
"text": "and the Raphaim;",
"start": 250.697,
"end": 252.977
},
{
"text": "the Amorites, the Chananites,",
"start": 254.058,
"end": 256.778
},
{
"text": "the Evites, the Gergesites,",
"start": 257.298,
"end": 260.578
},
{
"text": "and the Jebusites.",
"start": 264.498,
"end": 266.178
}
],
